# Copy this file to .env (same folder) and fill in real values.
# .env is git-ignored and never leaves this machine.

# OPTIONAL — the app works without it (Generate uses the built-in copy writer).
# With a key, the Generate button uses Claude AI (and reads the uploaded work photo).
#
# How to get one (5 minutes, needs a bank card):
#   1. Sign in / sign up at https://console.anthropic.com
#   2. Billing -> add a payment method (or claim free trial credits if offered)
#   3. API Keys -> Create Key -> copy the value starting with sk-ant-
#   4. Paste it below and restart the server (STOP-PTTR-ADS.bat, then START-PTTR-ADS.bat)
#
# Cost: this app uses claude-haiku-4-5; one ad generation is a fraction of a cent.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
